{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "GapWatch",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "GW001",
              "name": "OperationRemoved",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OperationRemoved"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An operation (method + path) that existed in the base contract no longer exists."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "An operation (method + path) that existed in the base contract no longer exists. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW001 OperationRemoved** (Breaking by default)\n\nAn operation (method + path) that existed in the base contract no longer exists.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW002",
              "name": "OperationDeprecated",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OperationDeprecated"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An operation was newly marked deprecated."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "An operation was newly marked deprecated. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW002 OperationDeprecated** (Info by default)\n\nAn operation was newly marked deprecated.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW003",
              "name": "OperationAdded",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OperationAdded"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A new operation was added."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "A new operation was added. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW003 OperationAdded** (Info by default)\n\nA new operation was added.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW004",
              "name": "OperationIdChanged",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OperationIdChanged"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The operationId changed. Generated clients (NSwag, Kiota, ...) name their methods after it, so this breaks callers of the generated code."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "The operationId changed. Generated clients (NSwag, Kiota, ...) name their methods after it, so this breaks callers of the generated code. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW004 OperationIdChanged** (Warning by default)\n\nThe operationId changed. Generated clients (NSwag, Kiota, ...) name their methods after it, so this breaks callers of the generated code.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW010",
              "name": "RequiredParameterAdded",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "RequiredParameterAdded"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A new required parameter was added; existing callers do not send it."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "A new required parameter was added; existing callers do not send it. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW010 RequiredParameterAdded** (Breaking by default)\n\nA new required parameter was added; existing callers do not send it.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW011",
              "name": "ParameterBecameRequired",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ParameterBecameRequired"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An optional parameter became required; callers that omitted it now fail."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "An optional parameter became required; callers that omitted it now fail. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW011 ParameterBecameRequired** (Breaking by default)\n\nAn optional parameter became required; callers that omitted it now fail.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW012",
              "name": "ParameterRemoved",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ParameterRemoved"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A parameter was removed. Callers that still send it may be rejected or silently ignored."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "A parameter was removed. Callers that still send it may be rejected or silently ignored. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW012 ParameterRemoved** (Warning by default)\n\nA parameter was removed. Callers that still send it may be rejected or silently ignored.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW020",
              "name": "TypeChanged",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "TypeChanged"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A type changed incompatibly. Requests: the server stopped accepting a type it accepted. Responses: the server may now return a type consumers do not expect. (integer to number widening is request-safe only.)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "A type changed incompatibly. Requests: the server stopped accepting a type it accepted. Responses: the server may now return a type consumers do not expect. (integer to number widening is request-safe only.) See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW020 TypeChanged** (Breaking by default)\n\nA type changed incompatibly. Requests: the server stopped accepting a type it accepted. Responses: the server may now return a type consumers do not expect. (integer to number widening is request-safe only.)\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW021",
              "name": "FormatChanged",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "FormatChanged"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A format changed incompatibly (for example int32 to int64 in a response, or date to date-time in either direction)."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "A format changed incompatibly (for example int32 to int64 in a response, or date to date-time in either direction). See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW021 FormatChanged** (Breaking by default)\n\nA format changed incompatibly (for example int32 to int64 in a response, or date to date-time in either direction).\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "api-compatibility"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GW022",
              "name": "NullabilityChanged",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "NullabilityChanged"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Requests: a nullable value became non-nullable. Responses: a non-nullable value became nullable."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "Requests: a nullable value became non-nullable. Responses: a non-nullable value became nullable. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW022 NullabilityChanged** (Breaking by default)\n\nRequests: a nullable value became non-nullable. Responses: a non-nullable value became nullable.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
