              "name": "EnumValueRemoved",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "EnumValueRemoved"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Request enum: an accepted value was removed, or an enum constraint was introduced on a previously free value."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "Request enum: an accepted value was removed, or an enum constraint was introduced on a previously free value. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW023 EnumValueRemoved** (Breaking by default)\n\nRequest enum: an accepted value was removed, or an enum constraint was introduced on a previously free value.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
