              "name": "EnumValueAdded",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "EnumValueAdded"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Response enum: a new value can be returned (or the enum constraint was dropped). Consumers with exhaustive handling or strict enum deserialization may fail."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
              "help": {
                "text": "Response enum: a new value can be returned (or the enum constraint was dropped). Consumers with exhaustive handling or strict enum deserialization may fail. See https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md",
                "markdown": "**GW024 EnumValueAdded** (Warning by default)\n\nResponse enum: a new value can be returned (or the enum constraint was dropped). Consumers with exhaustive handling or strict enum deserialization may fail.\n\n[All GapWatch rules](https://github.com/Quattordici/GapWatch/blob/main/docs/rules.md)"
              },
